// User Profile for `server` — a bare admin user for headless / server
// installs (the Minimal Profile). Merged under users/core/profile.jsonc, which
// is neutral now (ADR 0157); `programs_inherit: false` (ADR 0134) stays as an
// explicit guarantee that a headless box carries no GUI userland — the
// user-layer twin of the host's `packages.inherit: false`.
//
// sudo for administration; no workstation groups (no docker/libvirt/kvm). Bash
// shell, since the zsh tooling is a workstation program the bare user skips.
{
  "shell": "/bin/bash",
  "sudo": true,
  "groups": [],
  "programs_inherit": false,
  "programs": [],
  "ssh_authorized_keys": []
}
